# Internal handoff / snapshot / planning docs — kept locally, never pushed.
# Team members regenerate or maintain these on their own machine.
HANDOFF.md
HANDOVER.md
ONBOARDING.md
STATE_OF_FERAL.md
AGENT_PROMPT.md
ROADMAP_NEXT.md

# Internal-only: private demo scripts, walkthroughs, and the internal
# analysis dossier. Everything under these paths stays on local disk.
# Never pushed. CI's committed smoke tests (feral-core/tests/test_demo_*_smoke.py)
# protect the underlying pipelines without exposing the demos themselves.
private/
docs/analysis.md
docs/demos/

# Conductor / internal analysis docs — never ship to public repo.
.internal/

# Auto-generated by scripts/audit_routes.py — regenerated locally on demand.
docs/route_audit.md

# --- Audit / internal assessment artifacts — never push to public repo ---
# AUDIT-r14 is the current rolling audit dossier (findings, scoreboards,
# lane reports, wave handoffs, thesis scenario gates). Snapshots live
# under AUDIT-r14/synthesis/ when an internal scorecard is rotated out
# of the public docs tree. Anything matching these patterns must stay
# on local disk only — the operator-facing replacement is
# docs/mintlify/reference/capability-status.mdx.
AUDIT-r14/
AUDIT-r*/
**/SCOREBOARD*.md
**/SCORECARD*.md
docs/findings/
**/lane*-findings.md
WORK_LOG.md
WAVE_*.md
WAVE*.md
V1_0_RELEASE_HANDOFF.md
THESIS_SCENARIOS.md
RELATIONS.md

# Older internal conductor / comparative analysis docs (predate .internal/).
# Keep local only.
docs/OPENCLAW_LESSONS*.md
docs/AGENT_PROMPTS*.md
docs/AGENT_PROMPTS_FOLLOWUPS*.md
docs/critique.md
docs/WAVE5_HARDENING_PROMPT.md

# Local editor / agent config — not part of the shipped product.
.cursor/

# Regression-test scratch home: holds a real api_key, oauth state, and
